    "reason": "[ev-8eb1c59d91de] says a new field `reportProperties` was introduced, and its example sets it on a rule of a kyverno.io/v1 ClusterPolicy. [ev-1519b599b779] shows that `spec.rules[].reportProperties` was added to the ClusterPolicy CRD between 1.12.6 and 1.13.0 (∅ → object). The CRD validators also confirmed the field is new. The release text does not tie the field to one API version, so leaving version unset is right, and the subject and the `added` change type match the known fact vf-8c91563114f9.",
